{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOG WITCH</strong> combines the best of dice-driven roguelikes and deckbuilders to deliver a rich strategic experience. With quick runs, you\u2019ll harness diverse item sets, discover new synergies and face a wide variety of wild enemy encounters, each requiring clever thinking to master. If you enjoy the strategic layering of games like Slay The Spire or the dice-rolling unpredictability of Dicey Dungeons, Dog Witch offers a deeply replayable adventure that will keep you discovering new angles run after run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Dog Witch.... half doggo, half all powerful witch, all bark and bite! You\u2019re on a mission to overthrow your former master, the Mad Master Wizard, and roll your way through a surreal world of haunted vending machines, laser ponies, and skeletal sidekicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each short run is packed with discovery: <strong>combine over 150 magical artifacts</strong> (and their corrupted counterparts), <strong>summon unpredictable allies</strong>, and <strong>master the whims of enchanted dice</strong>. Easy to pick up, hard to master.... Dog Witch rewards clever builds, bold experimentation, and the ability to adapt on the fly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/1c29b3b4c135de3755d2a95ba9805187.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=896 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/1c29b3b4c135de3755d2a95ba9805187.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/1c29b3b4c135de3755d2a95ba9805187.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle <strong>gun-wielding Russian Dolls</strong>, <strong>vengeful Cat Ladies</strong>, and <strong>questionable Vending Machines</strong>. Each encounter is a chaotic puzzle, testing your synergy-building skills in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/09b112f18fa2ea8fd73340ef5b56db84.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/09b112f18fa2ea8fd73340ef5b56db84.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/09b112f18fa2ea8fd73340ef5b56db84.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Need friends? Summon Laser Ponies, gun-toting rats, skeleton sidekicks and more to fight by your side. Pair them with relics and spells to trigger clever chain reactions that tip even the wildest battles in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/95a22f0327eb6a77b200297ac6cb6c9c.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/95a22f0327eb6a77b200297ac6cb6c9c.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/95a22f0327eb6a77b200297ac6cb6c9c.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you think that you have mastered the game, try on different Dog Witch hats, each one introduces their own unique new twists and challenges which require clever new strategies to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/be3f338859b592dc0ddc74d2a65f40fc.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/be3f338859b592dc0ddc74d2a65f40fc.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/be3f338859b592dc0ddc74d2a65f40fc.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your fur, hat, bark, and even your chonk level. Recreate your own pet or conjure something cursed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/4fc8ad8e5b4095540670fad95a391c92.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/4fc8ad8e5b4095540670fad95a391c92.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/4fc8ad8e5b4095540670fad95a391c92.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice and conjure synergy-driven spells in a captivating hypnotic trance, carried by dreamy trip-hop tunes and whimsical visuals. Feel the daily grind dissolve away as Dog Witch frees you from the everyday noise and gets you into the roguelike flow state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3548520?t=1761912867","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/d7e54d756d4c8205ae5da748fd9b403af947bd8b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761912867","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/21bfa27fdc8bbf08a2f25bd3e7af0471773df767/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761912867","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/21bfa27fdc8bbf08a2f25bd3e7af0471773df767/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761912867","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3724730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOG WITCH</strong> combines the best of dice-driven roguelikes and deckbuilders to deliver a rich strategic experience. With quick runs, you\u2019ll harness diverse item sets, discover new synergies and face a wide variety of wild enemy encounters, each requiring clever thinking to master. If you enjoy the strategic layering of games like Slay The Spire or the dice-rolling unpredictability of Dicey Dungeons, Dog Witch offers a deeply replayable adventure that will keep you discovering new angles run after run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Dog Witch.... half doggo, half all powerful witch, all bark and bite! You\u2019re on a mission to overthrow your former master, the Mad Master Wizard, and roll your way through a surreal world of haunted vending machines, laser ponies, and skeletal sidekicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each short run is packed with discovery: <strong>combine over 150 magical artifacts</strong> (and their corrupted counterparts), <strong>summon unpredictable allies</strong>, and <strong>master the whims of enchanted dice</strong>. Easy to pick up, hard to master.... Dog Witch rewards clever builds, bold experimentation, and the ability to adapt on the fly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/1c29b3b4c135de3755d2a95ba9805187.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=896 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/1c29b3b4c135de3755d2a95ba9805187.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/1c29b3b4c135de3755d2a95ba9805187.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle <strong>gun-wielding Russian Dolls</strong>, <strong>vengeful Cat Ladies</strong>, and <strong>questionable Vending Machines</strong>. Each encounter is a chaotic puzzle, testing your synergy-building skills in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/09b112f18fa2ea8fd73340ef5b56db84.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/09b112f18fa2ea8fd73340ef5b56db84.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/09b112f18fa2ea8fd73340ef5b56db84.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Need friends? Summon Laser Ponies, gun-toting rats, skeleton sidekicks and more to fight by your side. Pair them with relics and spells to trigger clever chain reactions that tip even the wildest battles in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/95a22f0327eb6a77b200297ac6cb6c9c.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/95a22f0327eb6a77b200297ac6cb6c9c.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/95a22f0327eb6a77b200297ac6cb6c9c.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you think that you have mastered the game, try on different Dog Witch hats, each one introduces their own unique new twists and challenges which require clever new strategies to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/be3f338859b592dc0ddc74d2a65f40fc.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/be3f338859b592dc0ddc74d2a65f40fc.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/be3f338859b592dc0ddc74d2a65f40fc.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your fur, hat, bark, and even your chonk level. Recreate your own pet or conjure something cursed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/4fc8ad8e5b4095540670fad95a391c92.poster.avif?t=1761912867\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/4fc8ad8e5b4095540670fad95a391c92.webm?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/extras/4fc8ad8e5b4095540670fad95a391c92.mp4?t=1761912867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice and conjure synergy-driven spells in a captivating hypnotic trance, carried by dreamy trip-hop tunes and whimsical visuals. Feel the daily grind dissolve away as Dog Witch frees you from the everyday noise and gets you into the roguelike flow state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Heckmouse"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548520/e9fbffd6c0bfacca3cc0750e4ac5caa8092ac552/header.jpg?t=1761912867","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.7 and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1,3GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB Video Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548520/1675925293/7998aaeb01c0d37f48ccad933494fa2d8602996f/1760019292/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760020854","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548520/1675925293/7998aaeb01c0d37f48ccad933494fa2d8602996f/1760019292/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760020854","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3548520/167592529